  "Ninety Thousand Li": {
   "rule": "The Last of Phù Dao, full set (3 pieces): each blow you evade winds the whirlwind tighter, granting 1 Wind buff stack for 8 s. When you cast a Wind escape or footwork art (tagged escape or step) with 8 or more Wind buff stacks, you spend them all on a gust: for 2 s the foe's hits on you deal 20 % less (dampen_taken 25), and you gain 2.5 % evasion for 4 s for each stack spent.",
   "approx": "Matches Wind arts tagged escape or step so Thôi Dương Giác's Gale Courier footwork arts (three-step-chase, swallow-stance) trigger the gust alongside any Wind escape art (no Wind escape art exists in the library yet).",
   "records": [
    {
     "id": "eff:Ninety Thousand Li wind",
     "on": "evaded",
     "do": [
      {
       "stacks": {
        "el": "wind",
        "n": 1,
        "for": 8.0,
        "side": "own"
